---
const faqs = [
  { q: 'How many hours daily is the program?', a: 'Each day\'s session lasts approximately 2 hours, giving students enough time to learn, participate, and ask questions without overwhelming their schedule.' },
  { q: 'Does my child need any prior knowledge about money or investing before joining?', a: 'Not at all. The program is designed for beginners, so your child can join with no prior financial knowledge. We start from the fundamentals and build practical money skills step by step.' },
  { q: 'Are the classes live or recorded?', a: 'The sessions are live and interactive, allowing students to ask questions and engage with instructors. Recordings will also be available for registered participants.' },
  { q: 'Are there any extra costs after registration?', a: 'No. Your registration fee covers the full program, including all teaching sessions, digital materials, and access to the recordings.' },
  { q: 'Can my child join from outside Nigeria?', a: 'Absolutely. The program is fully virtual, so students can participate from anywhere in the world with a stable internet connection.' },
  { q: 'What if we can\'t attend one of the days?', a: 'No problem. Since all sessions are recorded, your child can catch up at a convenient time and won\'t miss the valuable lessons.' },
]
---
<section class="bg-[#ffbd40] py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#3D2B00] mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-black">Everything You Need to Know</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-black/10">
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <div class="p-8 border-b-2 border-b-transparent hover:border-b-black/40 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-black mb-3 leading-snug">{faq.q}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-black/60 leading-relaxed">{faq.a}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
